{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"一、二十三年。春王正月，叔孫舍如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"二、癸丑，叔鞅卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"三、晉人執我行人叔孫舍。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"四、晉人圍郊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"郊者何？天子之邑也。曷為不繫于周？不與伐天子也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"五、夏六月，蔡侯東國卒于楚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"六、秋七月，莒子庚輿來奔。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"七、戊辰，吳敗頓、胡、沈、蔡、陳、許之師于雞父。胡子髠、沈子楹滅，獲陳夏齧。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"此偏戰也，曷為以詐戰之辭言之？不與夷狄之主中國也。然則曷為不使中國主之？中國亦新夷狄也。其言滅獲何？別君臣也，君死于位曰滅，生得曰獲，大夫生死皆曰獲。不與夷狄之主中國，則其言獲陳夏齧何？吳少進也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"八、天王居于狄泉。尹氏立王子朝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"此未三年，其稱天王何？著有天子也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"九、八月乙未，地震。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"十、冬，公如晉，至河，公有疾乃復。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_203_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_203","textTraditional":"何言乎公有疾乃復？殺恥也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}